<text x="386.08" y="254" size="5.08" layer="94">POWER SUPPLY CIRCUIT</text>
<text x="400.685" y="33.02" size="2.54" layer="213" ratio="15">+</text>
<text x="400.685" y="27.94" size="2.54" layer="213" ratio="15" rot="MR180">-</text>
<text x="395.224" y="36.83" size="0.8128" layer="94" ratio="15">LI-ION_BATTERY</text>
<text x="340.36" y="809.625" size="3.81" layer="94">2 x [4Gb DDR3 SDRAM (256Mx16)]</text>
<text x="459.74" y="485.14" size="5.08" layer="94">MicroSD</text>
<text x="290.83" y="110.49" size="2.54" layer="213" ratio="15" rot="R180">5VDC Only!!!</text>
<text x="217.678" y="327.66" size="6.4516" layer="94">Joystick</text>
<text x="440.055" y="346.71" size="5.08" layer="94">USB-HOSTs</text>
<text x="438.15" y="172.72" size="1.778" layer="214" ratio="15">1V3/30mA</text>
<text x="438.15" y="165.735" size="1.778" layer="214" ratio="15">3V/200mA</text>
<text x="438.15" y="158.115" size="1.778" layer="214" ratio="15">2V8/200mA</text>
<text x="438.15" y="194.945" size="1.778" layer="214" ratio="15">1V2/1.2A</text>
<text x="436.88" y="210.185" size="1.778" layer="214" ratio="15">1V2/1.6A</text>
<text x="438.15" y="142.875" size="1.778" layer="214" ratio="15">2V8/200mA</text>
<text x="421.005" y="120.015" size="0.6096" layer="214">Must be Floating!!!</text>
<text x="467.36" y="424.18" size="5.08" layer="94">HDMI</text>
<text x="441.96" y="287.02" size="6.4516" layer="94">Touch
pad</text>
<text x="481.33" y="52.451" size="1.778" layer="214" ratio="15">Rc</text>
<text x="481.33" y="39.751" size="1.778" layer="214" ratio="15">Rd</text>
<text x="444.5" y="32.131" size="1.778" layer="214" ratio="15">Vout=0.6x(1+Rc/Rd)</text>
<text x="372.11" y="27.051" size="1.778" layer="214" ratio="15">Re</text>
<text x="359.41" y="16.891" size="1.778" layer="214" ratio="15">Rf</text>
<text x="350.52" y="9.271" size="1.778" layer="214" ratio="15">Vout=0.6x(1+Re/Rf)</text>
<text x="231.14" y="251.46" size="6.4516" layer="94">ADC</text>
<text x="254" y="708.66" size="1.27" layer="94">We have used a number of fully compatible </text>
<text x="254" y="706.12" size="1.27" layer="94">but different DDR3 memories due to supply unavailability.</text>
<text x="254" y="703.58" size="1.27" layer="94">In such cases the memory part name</text>
<text x="254" y="701.04" size="1.27" layer="94">in the schematic might remain outdated.</text>
<text x="254" y="698.5" size="1.27" layer="94">It is recommended to always refer to the</text>
<text x="254" y="695.96" size="1.27" layer="94">exact memory name printed on the component itself. </text>
<text x="424.815" y="325.755" size="1.778" layer="214">Iset = 6800/Rs</text>
<text x="422.275" y="322.58" size="1.778" layer="214">Iset = 13k 523mA-&gt; 10k 680mA</text>
<text x="446.405" y="313.69" size="1.778" layer="214">Rs</text>
<text x="187.96" y="134.62" size="1.778" layer="94">TVin can be
connected to 
GND if not used</text>
<wire x1="513.08" y1="508" x2="513.08" y2="632.46" width="0.4064" layer="94" style="longdash"/>
<wire x1="302.26" y1="632.46" x2="513.08" y2="632.46" width="0.4064" layer="94" style="longdash"/>
